{
  "title": "Aimeos Core \u2014 e-commerce, marketplace, B2B (4,497\u2605)",
  "content": "Project: Aimeos Core\nDomain: e-commerce, marketplace, B2B | Scale: large | Stars: 4,497\nProblem: Provides a high-performance, modular e-commerce framework for building online shops, marketplaces, and B2B applications with flexibility and scalability without monolithic constraints.\nTarget users: Medium to large businesses, Marketplace operators, B2B enterprises, E-commerce developers, System integrators\nCore features: Product catalog management; Shopping cart and checkout; Order management system; Admin interface; Marketplace/multi-vendor support; B2B functionality; Integration framework for ERP/CRM systems\nIntegrations: Content management systems, Customer relationship management (CRM), Enterprise resource planning (ERP), Multiple payment gateways, Third-party fulfillment systems\nTech stack: PHP\nKey libraries: Aimeos e-commerce library, Composer (dependency management)\nArchitecture: microservices\nDesign lessons:\n- Modular architecture with pluggable front-ends allows flexibility and custom implementations without monolithic constraints\n- Core library separation enables integration into existing systems (CMS, CRM, ERP) for enterprise adoption\n- Performance optimization is a primary design goal, evidenced by 'ultra fast' positioning and high-star adoption rate\n- Framework designed for scalability supporting both single shops and large-scale marketplace operations",
